#. translators: Second paragraph describing that same option. Keep the bold tags around the two WPML feature names.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:287
msgid "You translate in the WPML <b>Translation Editor</b>. This works with automatic translation and <b>Translate Everything</b>."
msgstr "Вы переводите в <b>редакторе переводов</b> WPML. Это работает с автоматическим переводом и функцией <b>Переводить все</b>."

#. translators: First paragraph describing the "Each language has its own content" option.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:292
msgid "Every language’s pages are written and maintained on their own. Fields start as a copy of the original, then go their own way."
msgstr "Страницы на каждом языке пишутся и поддерживаются отдельно. Поля создаются как копия оригинала, а затем ведутся самостоятельно."

#. translators: Second paragraph describing that same option; "them" are the language versions.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:294
msgid "You edit each language in the WordPress editor. WPML does not sync them afterwards, and automatic translation does not apply."
msgstr "Вы редактируете каждый язык в редакторе WordPress. WPML не синхронизирует их впоследствии, и автоматический перевод не применяется."

#. translators: First paragraph describing the Expert option; "Expert" is the option's own name, translated the same way in the option list.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:299
msgid "If you are migrating a site, your existing field groups will use the Expert setup. This allows you to manually choose the translation option for each field in the group."
msgstr "Если вы переносите сайт, ваши существующие группы полей будут использовать экспертный режим. Это позволяет вам вручную выбирать вариант перевода для каждого поля в группе."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s will wrap the string in a <b> html tag
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:301
#, php-format
msgid "This option is %1$snot recommended%2$s for new field groups."
msgstr "Этот вариант %1$sне рекомендуется%2$s для новых групп полей."

#. translators: Link under the Expert option; it opens the ACFML documentation.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:303
msgid "Expert setup documentation"
msgstr "Документация по экспертному режиму"

#. translators: Button under each translation option that picks it. Verb, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:307
msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Выбрать"

#. translators: Badge next to the translation option WPML suggests. Lower case, as it sits inside the option card.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:309
msgid "recommended for this site"
msgstr "рекомендуется для этого сайта"

#. translators: Button that reopens the translation options after one was chosen. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:311
msgid "Change option"
msgstr "Изменить вариант"

#. translators: Title of the tooltip introducing the new field group setup.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:314
msgid "A Much Simpler Way to Translate Your ACF Sites"
msgstr "Гораздо более простой способ перевода ваших сайтов на ACF"

#. translators: Body of the tooltip introducing the new field group setup. "ACFML" is the plugin's short name and stays in English.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:316
msgid "This new release of ACFML allows you to configure multilingual sites in one-click, instead of many complex settings. Choose how to setup the translation for the fields."
msgstr "Этот новый выпуск ACFML позволяет настраивать многоязычные сайты одним щелчком мыши вместо множества сложных настроек. Выберите, как настроить перевод для полей."

#. translators: Button that opens WPML's settings, in the dialog about a post type or taxonomy that cannot be translated. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:322
msgid "Go to WPML Settings"
msgstr "Перейти в настройки WPML"

#. translators: Link under the translation options that opens the documentation.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:329
msgid "Need help choosing?"
msgstr "Нужна помощь с выбором?"

#. translators: Link in the Multilingual Setup panel that opens the ACFML documentation. Noun.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:331
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Документация"

#. translators: Link in the Multilingual Setup panel about translating the fields' names. Keep the arrow at the end.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:333
msgid "How to translate field labels »"
msgstr "Как переводить ярлыки полей »"

#. translators: Line in the Multilingual Setup panel saying what the chosen option covers: what is typed into the fields, not their names.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:335
msgid "This setup translates field values."
msgstr "Эта настройка переводит значения полей."

#. translators: Line in the Multilingual Setup panel about translating the fields' names. "ACF Field Group" is the type the Translation Dashboard shows for these strings; keep the bold tags around the screen name.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:337
msgid "Translate field labels and dropdown choice labels separately. Find them under ACF Field Group in the <b>Translation Dashboard</b>."
msgstr "Переводите метки полей и метки вариантов раскрывающегося списка отдельно. Они находятся в разделе ACF Field Group в <b>Панели управления переводами</b>."

#. translators: Title of the dialog listing what saving the field group will change. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:364
msgid "Review these translation setting changes"
msgstr "Проверьте эти изменения настроек перевода"

#. translators: Line above the list of changes in that dialog; the list follows the colon.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:366
msgid "Saving this field group makes these changes:"
msgstr "Сохранение этой группы полей вносит следующие изменения:"

#. translators: %1$s is a field label, %2$s the preference it had, %3$s the preference it gets. Keep the quotation marks your language uses around the two values.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:373
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: from “%2$s” to “%3$s”"
msgstr "%1$s: с «%2$s» на «%3$s»"

#. translators: Line in that dialog shown when the field group moves to the Expert option.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:378
msgid "Switching to the field-by-field setup keeps every field's current setting. From here you set each field yourself."
msgstr "Переключение на пополевую настройку сохраняет текущие параметры каждого поля. Отсюда вы настраиваете каждое поле самостоятельно."

#. translators: Line in that dialog about content translated from now on.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:380
msgid "New translations use the new settings automatically."
msgstr "Новые переводы автоматически используют новые настройки."

#. translators: Shown in a change row in place of the old value, when the field had no translation preference before.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:384
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Не задано"

#. translators: Line in that dialog when no translated post uses the field group.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:389
msgid "No posts with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again."
msgstr "Записи с переводами еще не используют эту группу полей, поэтому ничего не нужно отправлять повторно."

#. translators: Line in that dialog when no translated category, tag or other term uses the field group.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:391
msgid "No terms with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again."
msgstr "Элементы с переводами еще не используют эту группу полей, поэтому ничего не нужно отправлять повторно."

#. translators: Line in that dialog when neither a translated post nor a translated term uses the field group.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:393
msgid "No posts or terms with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again."
msgstr "Записи или элементы с переводами еще не используют эту группу полей, поэтому ничего не нужно отправлять повторно."

#. translators: Label of the option that leaves existing translations alone. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:395
msgid "Only apply to new translations"
msgstr "Применять только к новым переводам"

#. translators: Shown in that dialog while the affected posts are being counted. Keep the three dots.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:397
msgid "Checking how much content this affects..."
msgstr "Проверка объема затрагиваемого контента..."

#. translators: Button that confirms the dialog and saves the field group. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:401
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Сохранить изменения"

#. translators: Button that closes the dialog without saving the field group.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:403
msgid "No, go back"
msgstr "Нет, вернуться"

#. translators: Line in that dialog about the posts that already have translations; "them" are those posts.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:415
msgid "Updating them sends them for translation again, which may use translation words."
msgstr "Их обновление снова отправляет их на перевод, при котором могут расходоваться слова для перевода."

#. translators: Line in that dialog about the posts that already have translations, when WPML does not translate content automatically; "them" and "their" are those posts.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:419
msgid "Updating them marks their translations as needing an update. WPML does not send them for translation. You can send them from the Translation Dashboard."
msgstr "При их обновлении их переводы будут помечены как требующие обновления. WPML не отправляет их на перевод автоматически. Вы можете отправить их из Панели управления переводами."

#. translators: %d is the number of fields in the field group.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:450
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:459
#, php-format
