#. translators: First sentence of the notice on a field group attached to an ACF options page. "Options page" is ACF's own name for that screen.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:598
msgid "This field group is shown on an Options page."
msgstr "Эта группа полей отображается на странице опций."

#. translators: Second sentence of that notice; "That" is the content on an options page.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:600
msgid "That is usually site-wide content like your header, footer, or global blocks."
msgstr "Обычно это контент, используемый на всем сайте, например хедер, футер или глобальные блоки."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s will wrap the string in a <a> link html tag
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:603
#, php-format
